[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508752598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2508752598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99856","id":2508752598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ViIbW","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T00:25:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T01:51:23Z","body":"There probably should be a sister pr to add a way to remove/disable the title buttons. There's just about never a reason to have a minimize button if the user can't restore the window. I can do it for Windows, or rather I already have something... But I would appreciate if someone could inform me what options are available on other platforms in regards to that so the approach is compatible.\r\nFor reference, in Windows the title buttons can be visible, disabled(greyd e.g. when unresizable is true) or hidden(disabled and not visible) and in sysmenu or not. Personally I only use visible/disabled i.e remove `WS_MINIMIZEBOX` and `WS_MAXIMIZEBOX`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508752598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508987446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2508987446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99856","id":2508987446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VjBw2","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T14:59:34Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T14:59:34Z","body":"This PR does not seem to address the problem stated in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8467 :\r\n\r\nThe proposal OP says:\r\n> I am working on a widget software for windows and the user can creates different widgets (which are windows in godot) with many types of functionality.\r\n\r\nAnd:\r\n\r\n> The feature would help me overcome the issue by hiding the godot app from the taskbar, not interfering with the user workflow or filled with unnecessary icons.\r\n\r\nThis means removing the app from the taskbar:\r\n1. For visible windows (widget)\r\n2. Possibly for the main window too (unclear from the OP but likely)\r\n\r\nBoth things does not seem to be possible with the implementation in this PR.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508987446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508996597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2508996597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99856","id":2508996597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VjD_1","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T15:15:16Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T16:46:01Z","body":"> This PR does not seem to address the problem stated in [godotengine/godot-proposals#8467](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8467) :\r\n> \r\n> The proposal OP says:\r\n> \r\n> > I am working on a widget software for windows and the user can creates different widgets (which are windows in godot) with many types of functionality.\r\n> \r\n> And:\r\n> \r\n> > The feature would help me overcome the issue by hiding the godot app from the taskbar, not interfering with the user workflow or filled with unnecessary icons.\r\n> \r\n> This means removing the app from the taskbar:\r\n> \r\n>     1. For visible windows (widget)\r\n> \r\n>     2. Possibly for the main window too (unclear from the OP but likely)\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> Both things does not seem to be possible with the implementation in this PR.\r\n\r\n\r\n> There are currently 2 arbitrary limitations that can be removed if folks find them too restrictive.\r\n\r\nFair enough, removing main window limitation is trivial. But do you also imply that the window's taskbar visibility should be toggleable when the window is visible?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508996597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509035298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2509035298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99856","id":2509035298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VjNci","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T16:47:47Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T16:47:47Z","body":"Removed both constraints, widget app should be possible now :>\r\n\r\nIf other platforms can't toggle visibility, then that should be documented.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2509035298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654134899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2654134899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99856","id":2654134899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eMuJz","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T15:54:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T15:54:55Z","body":"> However, when game window embedding is enabled (with floating window also enabled), the **Skip Taskbar** project setting won't be effective.\r\n> \r\n> ![image](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/180032/412445866-68655eac-76ba-4a48-81f2-085ef5dc178f.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3MzkzNzQ4MTMsIm5iZiI6MTczOTM3NDUxMywicGF0aCI6Ii8xODAwMzIvNDEyNDQ1ODY2LTY4NjU1ZWFjLTc2YmEtNGE0OC04MWYyLTA4NWVmNWRjMTc4Zi5wbmc_.wKbkDjGinesbt7LamUIs8OXXAlA843llUj7RngkMe_s)\r\n> \r\n> We should either make it so it affects the floating game window in this case (if possible), or document this behavior.\r\n\r\nI see where you are coming from but I don't think it'd be a good idea unless the other window options work on the embedding window and/or have a note as well. Otherwise the inconsistency would give the impression that the other options without the note do or should work. \r\n\r\nThat said, I do think some of the options probably could affect the appearance of the embedding window and/or its behavior; Something that warrants a discussion and to be decided in other pr.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654134899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2795432655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99856#issuecomment-2795432655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is